graph TD
    %% User Input
    User([👤 User Input]) -->|Text: 'Walk Cooper at 7am'| UI[💻 Streamlit UI / FastAPI]

    %% AI Processing
    UI -->|Sends Text| Agent[🧠 AI Agent - llm_agent.py]
    Agent -->|Prompt & API Key| OpenRouter{☁️ OpenRouter API}

    %% Success Path
    OpenRouter -->|Valid JSON| Guardrail{🛡️ Guardrails Validation}
    
    %% Failure Path
    OpenRouter -.->|Error 404/429/503| Fallback[🔙 Regex Fallback - nl_parser.py]

    %% Guardrail Check
    Guardrail -->|Invalid Time/Pet| Fallback
    Guardrail -->|Valid Data| Task[🐾 pawpal_system.Task Object]
    Fallback -->|Processed Data| Task

    %% System Execution
    Task -->|Saved to| DB[(💾 Session State / JSON)]
    Task -->|Processed by| Scheduler[📅 Scheduler Logic]
    Scheduler -->|Output| Results([📋 Schedule & Conflicts])

    %% Styling
    style Agent fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Guardrail fill:#dfd,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Fallback fill:#fdd,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px